<!-- MASTHEAD -->
<header class="mast">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brandbar">
      <img class="logo" src="bb-logo-shalartem.png" alt="Shal'Artem">
      <div class="lockup"><span class="by">A Shalina Healthcare brand</span><img class="logo" src="bb-logo-shalina.png" alt="Shalina Healthcare"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="mast-top">
      <div class="mast-copy">
        <p class="kicker"><b>Shal'Artem</b> presents &nbsp;·&nbsp; Nigeria &nbsp;·&nbsp; A National Dance Competition</p>
        <h1 class="title">BOUNCE BACK</h1>
        <p class="subhead">Three counts down. <span class="gold">Rise</span> on four.</p>
        <p class="lede">Not the three days — what you do after them. Nigeria's comeback dance, open to everyone with a body and a moment worth rising for. This is the working brief: the move, the money, the timeline, and the guardrails.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="mast-art">
        <img alt="A dancer rising into the fourth count under stadium light" src="data:image/webp;base64,">
        <figcaption>Count four — the rise.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="glance">
      <div><p class="k">Budget</p><p class="v">$10,000<small>$7k ops + $3k prizes</small></p></div>
      <div><p class="k">Build</p><p class="v">8 days<small>live on day 9</small></p></div>
      <div><p class="k">Run</p><p class="v">4 weeks<small>Nigeria · NMA-endorsed</small></p></div>
      <div><p class="k">Grand prize</p><p class="v">$1,200<small>"Moment Made"</small></p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- VERDICT / SUMMARY -->
<div class="verdict">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="badge">The idea in one line</span>
    <p><b>Three counts down, rise on four.</b> A signature move anyone can do in a doorway, a market, a stadium — the body telling the brand's truth: the fever takes three days; the moment you rise is yours. We don't ask Nigeria to talk about malaria. We ask Nigeria to show us the comeback.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- WHY DANCE -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why dance carries this</p>
      <h2>The move <span class="gold">is</span> the message.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="twocol">
      <div>
        <p><strong>The theme is physical.</strong> "Bounce back" is literally a movement — no brand metaphor to explain. Down, down, down, UP.</p>
        <p><strong>It's the house's proven format.</strong> Street style + user content + micro-influencers is the machine Shalina already runs in Nigeria. We're loading a proven gun with a sharper bullet.</p>
        <p><strong>Dance travels where copy can't.</strong> A move needs no literacy, no language split, no caption. Lagos to Kano, one grammar.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p><strong>It keeps us clean.</strong> Nobody dances a medical claim. The clinical truth stays in the brand's own endorsed line; the public's contribution is joy, recovery-energy, life resumed — the safest compliance posture available, safer even than testimony.</p>
        <p><strong>Sound + move = algorithm.</strong> An ownable audio plus a copyable signature move is the one UGC format that reliably compounds on TikTok and Reels in Nigeria — and we own the sound outright.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

