<section class="tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">The signature move · "3 down, rise on 4"</p>
      <h2>Everyone starts identical. <span class="gold">Everyone finishes different.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="twocol">
      <div>
        <p><strong>Counts 1&nbsp;–&nbsp;2&nbsp;–&nbsp;3:</strong> low, heavy, coiled — shoulders drop a beat each count. The weight. The three days.</p>
        <p><strong>Count 4 — the RISE:</strong> explode up into YOUR move. Shaku, gbese, zanku, a spin, a leap. The first three counts belong to the brand; <strong class="orange">the fourth count belongs to Nigeria.</strong></p>
        <p>Filmable in 15 seconds: three-down-rise-on-four twice, then freestyle out. Judges score the fourth count — originality — which is what turns a challenge into a competition.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:24px">
          <span class="biglead">The first three counts belong to the brand.<br><span class="orange">The fourth belongs to Nigeria.</span></span>
