      <div class="tag"><small>Tier 1 · the floor</small>THE STREETS</div>
      <p>UGC floor — everyone. Post your Bounce Back, your fourth count, the sound. Solo, family, workplace, market, church-steps after service. Weekly winners voted in by the public. WhatsApp channel for those who won't post publicly — load-bearing in this market.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tier">
      <div class="tag"><small>Tier 2 · the show</small>THE CREWS</div>
      <p>Registered dance crews (2–8) battle through the run — the craft tier. Crews bring choreography, costume, location craft, and feed the brand's own video content and future films.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tier">
      <div class="tag"><small>Tier 3 · the fuse</small>THE IGNITERS</div>
      <p><strong>15 Nigerian micro-influencers</strong> from our own WhatsApp roster seed the move inside the launch 48-hour window and keep the feed busy through the run. Micro over mega, deliberately: comment-section trust and geographic spread. They <strong class="orange">post their own entries but cannot win</strong> — they're pace-setters who set the standard, with paid-partnership disclosure. The prizes stay with the public floor.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="note" style="margin-top:26px">
      <p><b>The story floor.</b> Every entry caption invites one line — <em>"My moment I'll never miss: ___."</em> The dance carries the reach; the line carries the brand story home and mines the best stories for next season's films.</p>
